{
  "slug": "liquid-skills",
  "name": "Liquid Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Liquid language fundamentals, CSS/JS/HTML coding standards, and WCAG accessibility patterns for Shopify themes",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `liquid-theme-a11y` (Implement WCAG 2.2 accessibility patterns in Shopify Liquid themes), `liquid-theme-standards` (CSS, JavaScript, and HTML coding standards for Shopify Liquid themes), `shopify-liquid-themes` (Generate Shopify Liquid theme code (sections, blocks, snippets) with correct schema JSON, LiquidDoc headers, translation keys, and CSS/JS…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install liquid-skills@claude-plugins-official` from `Shopify/liquid-skills` (`plugins/liquid-skills`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
